437
00:22:59.757 --> 00:23:02.253
Configurable tax, currency and payments.

438
00:23:02.533 --> 00:23:03.791
Org and ownership.

439
00:23:04.071 --> 00:23:05.309
Rollout and risk.

440
00:23:06.659 --> 00:23:07.491
