486
00:26:32.589 --> 00:26:38.392
Log it: date, prompt, level, scores, the two changes, and whether last mock's changes happened.

487
00:26:39.742 --> 00:26:40.595
Pacing.

488
00:26:40.875 --> 00:26:43.307
L1's six mocks show the usual pattern.

489
00:26:43.587 --> 00:26:50.947
